### Create as user A -> 201, saves postId
POST http://localhost:8080/api/post
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Butter Chicken",
  "body": "Marinate the chicken in yogurt and spices, then simmer in a tomato butter sauce.",
  "imageUrl": "{{imageUrl}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("postId", response.body.postId); %}

### No token -> 401 "Please login first"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should fail",
  "body": "No token"
}

### Fake token -> 401 "Your session has expired, please login again"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/post
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should fail",
  "body": "Fake token"
}

### Empty title -> 400 (backend validation, even if the frontend is bypassed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/post
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "body": "Title is blank"
}
